## 177. Master Cheat Sheet

```text
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║       CODING-DECODING CHEAT SHEET            ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ A=1 ... Z=26                                 ║
║ Reverse value = 27 - position                ║
║                                              ║
║ A↔Z B↔Y C↔X D↔W E↔V F↔U G↔T               ║
║ H↔S I↔R J↔Q K↔P L↔O M↔N                   ║
║                                              ║
║ Z+1=A                                        ║
║ A-1=Z                                        ║
║                                              ║
║ Constant shift → calculate differences       ║
║ Mirror → check x + y = 27                    ║
║ Reverse → check position order               ║
║ Sum → add alphabet positions                 ║
║ Length → count letters                        ║
║ First → first letter position                 ║
║ Last → last letter position                  ║
║ Chinese → compare common words/codes         ║
║ Substitution → follow renamed objects        ║
║ Operator → decode symbols before calculating ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

